-- 登记: A02 | 语义: NBOX-N1 的 POS 写回 E 0 N 0 U 0 | expected_net: cancelled | restore 搭档: 本文件是 geom/nbox_move_apply.mac 的 restore
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-GEOM-NBOXMOVE-RESTORE-ALIVE
/AIOS-SUITE-NBOX-N1
Q REF
Q NAME
Q POS
POS E 0 N 0 U 0
Q POS
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite geom/nbox_move restore: NBOX-N1 POS E 0'
$P SUITE-GEOM-NBOXMOVE-RESTORE-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
